> not
> > collide with IRQ 11 of the CAN bus card (see attached lspci.txt).
> >
> > The only other device that uses IRQ 11 is
> > # 00:00.0 Host bridge [0600]: Intel Corporation 5520 I/O Hub to ESI Port
